# =============================================================================
# Crash Bandicoot 2 Launcher — LEGAL / SAFETY .gitignore
# If something here looks "useful to commit", it is NOT. Sony/Activision own
# Crash. We ship TOOLS + RUNTIME only. Never push dumps or game-derived code.
# When in doubt: do NOT force-add. Ask before `git add -f`.
# =============================================================================

# --- IDE / OS junk -----------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
.vs/
.vscode/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*~
riderModule.iml
/_ReSharper.Caches/
/packages/

# --- Build / publish outputs -------------------------------------------------
bin/
obj/
out/
publish/
publish-*/
publish-single/
artifacts/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
# Keep in-game ImGui debug panels (matched by [Dd]ebug/ above)
!**/Panels/Debug/
!**/Panels/Debug/**
x64/
x86/
*.appx
*.msix
*.msi
*.nupkg

# --- Retail disc dumps & images (THE lawsuit fuel) ---------------------------
*.bin
*.cue
*.iso
*.img
*.ecm
*.mds
*.mdf
*.nrg
*.ccd
*.sub
*.img.bak
*.toc
*.chd
*.cso
*.isz
*.pbp
*.cdi
*.dump
*.raw
# Common dump naming (even without extension tricks)
**/Crash Bandicoot*
**/crash*bandicoot*.bin
**/crash*bandicoot*.cue
**/SCES_009.67
**/SCES-00967*
**/SCES_009*
**/SCUS_941.54
**/SCUS-94154*

# --- Disc overlay payloads (mod asset folders) -------------------------------
examples/mods/**/disc/**
!examples/mods/**/disc/README.md
!examples/mods/**/disc/**/README.md
/mods/
/captures/

# Common Crash disc asset extensions anywhere
*.NSD
*.NSF
*.nsd
*.nsf
*.VAB
*.vab
*.VH
*.vh
*.SEQ
*.seq
*.STR
*.str
*.XA
*.xa

# --- Recompiled / derived game code (derivative of retail EXE) ---------------
CrashBandicoot2.Recompiled/**
!CrashBandicoot2.Recompiled/README.md
**/_gate_regen/
**/_test_apply*/
**/_patch_*main.cs
game.recomp.dll
**/game.recomp.dll
**/game.recomp.pdb
**/Recompiled/main.cs
**/Recompiled/Entry.cs
**/Recompiled/Stubs.cs
# Generated recomp output dirs only — keep CrashBandicoot2.Launcher/Recomp/
/recomp/
**/bin/**/recomp/
!CrashBandicoot2.Launcher/Recomp/
!CrashBandicoot2.Launcher/Recomp/**
# But never commit extracted NSF/GOOL blobs (retail-derived), even under Recomp/
CrashBandicoot2.Launcher/Recomp/overlays/
**/Recomp/overlays/**/*.bin

# Local one-off patch helpers (disc extract scripts, compile scratch)
/_patch30/
/_patch*/
/_tmp*/
/_gpcheck/

# --- Runtime / player data next to the exe ----------------------------------
settings.json
interface.ini
carda.sav
cardb.sav
save/
game/
*.sav
*.mcd
*.mcr
memcard*
*.srm

# --- Logs / crash dumps / temp -----------------------------------------------
logs/
*.log
*.tmp
*.temp
*.dmp
*.stackdump
hs_err_pid*

# --- Secrets / credentials ---------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
credentials*.json
*secret*
*apikey*
*.pfx
*.p12
*.pem
*.key

# --- Native / tooling noise --------------------------------------------------
*.pdb
crash-*.dmp
minidump*

# --- Optional: local notes that might contain dump paths ---------------------
LOCAL.md
TODO.local.md
*.local.json
run.bat

# Accidental nested Desktop/clone junk
/CrashBandicoot-Launcher 2/

_run_log.txt
